            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electrical stimulation system includes a stimulation device and a container. The stimulation device may be sealed within the container. A port in the container allows the stimulation device to be coupled with a lead. The stimulation device may be used before, during, and after subcutaneous surgery to apply electrical stimulation for nerve regeneration.</p>
